// Server-side strings for customer- and owner-facing texts (receipts, SMS, emails,
// in-app alerts generated by jobs). API error responses stay English on purpose:
// the frontend shows its own translated messages.
//
//   t(locale, key, vars)  -> string. Falls back to English, then to the key itself.
//   Plurals: when vars.count is a number, `${key}_one` / `${key}_other` are tried first.
//   Interpolation: {{name}}.
//
// Amharic / Afaan Oromo strings need review by a native speaker (see docs/AMHARIC_GLOSSARY.md).
